---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Returns"
  description="Sample returns policy architecture for the Harbour & Pine Home fictional portfolio store."
  path="/returns/"
>
  <section class="section-space pt-8">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Returns' }]} />
      <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl text-pine-dark">Returns</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 rounded-md bg-sand/70 px-3 py-2 text-sm">
        Illustrative policy for a fictional portfolio store. A real merchant must provide and approve its own terms.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-charcoal/85">
        <p>This page demonstrates how return windows, condition requirements and refund timing can be structured clearly.</p>
        <p>No real returns process is available because Harbour & Pine Home does not accept orders.</p>
        <p>Sample policy content does not provide legal compliance for any business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
